I admit that I was good before, but you who love me deserve better.
Vtuber Maker V1.4.0 brings new content!

We have added a live broadcast room, which can be used for more flexible live broadcast scene editing. We have also prefabricated several templates suitable for mainstream live broadcast scenes, such as e-commerce, stage, etc. Whether it is game, singing or office, there is always one suitable for you. Now let me introduce the content of the version in detail:

1. Added content display area, which can import video, photos, PPT and PDF files into VTuber Maker and display them in live broadcast, including screen sharing, such as game images;
2.Added  multiple people on the same platform , so that multiple roles can be controlled at the same time. Looking forward to the subsequent cloud platform interconnection;
3 The pop-up window function has been updated to make it easier for OBS to capture the push to the window;
4 The  characters have added some more interesting special effects , more content to wait for you to discover;
5. There are more dynamic resources, which provide more possibilities for live broadcasting.

Not only that, but our VTuber Editor is much more engaging.
VTuber Editor V1.3.0:
(1) Enhance the freedom of scene editing and re-create the prefabricated template;
(2) Support setting of character, element Angle, position and size;
(3) Added special effects for characters * 8;
(4) At most 3 characters can be selected in the same live broadcast scene;
(5) Online more than 100 scenes, animations and small elements, and provide custom upload function;
(6) Added idle action * 3.


Vtuber's happy world is waiting for you to play for free!
